# Paths excluded from SAST.
#
# Rationale: Semgrep must only report on code this repository OWNS and can fix.
# Findings in build output or in downloaded dependencies are not actionable here
# and train reviewers to ignore the gate — which is worse than not running it.
#
# This file deliberately does NOT exclude any first-party source or test code.

# Maven build output: compiled classes, unpacked dependencies, generated sources.
target/

# Scanner output. Reports contain the very patterns the scanners look for
# (e.g. a SARIF snippet quoting a flagged line), so scanning them is circular.
reports/

# Dependency lock/metadata caches.
.m2/
**/node_modules/

# Version control and CI internals.
.git/

# Documentation assets (SVG diagrams, rendered screenshots).
.udap/docs/
